From: Frank Wunderlich <frank-w@public-files.de>
Date: Thu, 17 Sep 2026 23:22:53 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] clk: mediatek: mt7987: fix pll call

commit
b7cd043b8412 clk: mediatek: Refactor pll registration to pass device
changed mtk_clk_register_plls from of-node to device-node

fix this

(cherry picked from commit 58f389fe32c0ff80eaf88035c551a68be786e313)
---
 drivers/clk/mediatek/clk-mt7987-apmixed.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/clk/mediatek/clk-mt7987-apmixed.c b/drivers/clk/mediatek/clk-mt7987-apmixed.c
index 2f8d0ed2a6f9d..902a6999b4802 100644
--- a/drivers/clk/mediatek/clk-mt7987-apmixed.c
+++ b/drivers/clk/mediatek/clk-mt7987-apmixed.c
@@ -78,7 +78,7 @@ static int clk_mt7987_apmixed_probe(struct platform_device *pdev)
 	clk_data = mtk_alloc_clk_data(ARRAY_SIZE(plls));
 	if (!clk_data)
 		return -ENOMEM;
-	r = mtk_clk_register_plls(node, plls, ARRAY_SIZE(plls), clk_data);
+	r = mtk_clk_register_plls(&pdev->dev, plls, ARRAY_SIZE(plls), clk_data);
 	if (r)
 		goto free_apmixed_data;
 	r = of_clk_add_hw_provider(node, of_clk_hw_onecell_get, clk_data);
